[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and the rear nut (1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connector (2a) and remove the speaker (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Right rear speaker (in rear parcel shelf)</p></td><td><p>P031</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2220.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Connect the electrical connector for the rear speaker.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right rear speaker (in rear parcel shelf)</p></td><td><p>P031</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Place the speaker in the housing.</p><p>3. Tighten the front fixing bolts (3a) and the rear nut (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2223.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]